cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DC-SST — Dispensing-Counter Stewardship Support Tool"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A counter-level tool for retail pharmacies in Nepal that identifies whether a
  dispensed product is an antibiotic, assigns its WHO AWaRe group, and records the
  sale as the measurement instrument for a stepped-wedge implementation study of
  antibiotic stewardship at the pharmacy counter.
